# ─── RecruitAI Monorepo Environment Setup ─────────────────────────────────────
# RecruitAI consists of three primary services:
# 1. backend/   - FastAPI + LangGraph + Supabase Vector Store
# 2. frontend/  - Next.js 16 App Router (Web Dashboard & Landing)
# 3. mobile/    - Expo SDK 57 / React Native (Android & iOS)
#
# Refer to the dedicated .env.example files inside each subdirectory:
# - backend/.env.example
# - frontend/.env.example
# - mobile/.env.example
#
# Quick Reference:
# - Production Web: https://recruitaiofficial.vercel.app
# - Production API: https://recruitai-vpbe.onrender.com
